From ca3c175f1bd1ed35ee1d896a510cab538a11faac Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: AMB-1 FM6 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 19:28:21 -0300
Subject: [PATCH 09/14] Each voice plays its patch's envelopes if asked: a Play
 page, Envelope and Gate

The pad breathed (a swell of seconds, Swell's) and the bass was one note held and faded in over 2.5 s, so a patch's
envelopes were never heard on them. A voice's Play page (PATCH's second): Envelope, AMB-1's own (Breath, A beat, Held,
as before) or Patch: each note struck and let go as a DX7 plays it (the pad's four at their breaths, at full at once;
the bass each chord; the bells each note) and Gate, how long the key is held (of the breath, the chord, a bar). CC 61
and 62 on the voices' channels. Project format 8 (format 7 carried over, its patches as they are).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
