From: AMB-1 FM6 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 20:04:18 -0300
Subject: [PATCH 11/14] The dice: SEL rolls the page shown, SEL with a page's
 button its layer, with EDIT new loops; held, undo

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
